@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title The code-tree migration in progress — the top-level legacy Code/ tree is retired; three FastAPI monoliths (FindCare/Code/app.py, sharedServices/Code/app.py, evaluateCare/Code/app.py) still run in parallel with the router-dispatched tool architecture that is meant to replace them. "Done" is the three refactor_conformance gates going green, not "a directory is gone".

package "The parked monoliths — one per component (top-level Code/ is gone from disk and from git)" #fdf6f6 {
  component "FindCare/Code/app.py\none file: 14 @app.post routes (~88 KB).\nImports ProviderManagement, SpecialtyFilter,\nClinicalTrials, ProviderDetail directly\n(NOT ProviderList, NOT Geo)." as APP
  component "FindCare/Code/ interim files\nfind_care_facade.py + provider_lookup_models.py\n(imported only by app.py)\nembedding_client.py (imported by app.py AND\nProviderDetail/provider_record_sync.py; BUG-003)\nprompt_system_maker.py (imported by app.py)\nsafety_service.py (is_emergency dead, no caller)\ntests/test_evalcare_handoff.py" as FCFILES
  component "sharedServices/Code/app.py (~24 KB)\nevaluateCare/Code/app.py (~8 KB)\nboth still monolithic FastAPI apps" as OTHERAPPS
}

package "The target the code is already moving into" #f5fbfa {
  component "The router\nsharedServices/Code/AuthorizationsAndAuthentications/\nuniversal_navigation_tool.py (~145 KB).\nAlready dispatches 19 tools via\n<module>.TOOL.run_and_log(deps, req)." as ROUTER
  component "ChatHealthyTool subclasses in feature dirs\nFindCare/ClinicalTrials/clinical_trials_tool.py\nFindCare/SpecialtyFilter/specialty_filter_tool.py\nsharedServices/Code/Geo/geo_tool.py\nprovider_search_tool.py + provider_detail_tool.py\n(today in the router dir, not a FindCare feature dir)\n+ 14 more (about_chathealthy, utterance_manager,\nfacility_search/selection, lockout, user_parameters,\noauth_login, clinical_trial_selection, ...)" as TOOLS
  component "Website/FindCareChat/\nReact shell (index.html, main.tsx, App.tsx)\n+ widgets under src/" as WEBSITE
  component "ChatHealthyLib\nchathealthy_lib.llm facade" as LIB
}

component "refactor_conformance.py\narchitecture/EngineeringRuleEnforcement/code/\nThree gates define done. Current: 1 of 3 PASS." as GATES #eef6ff

APP --> TOOLS : the 14 routes become tools the\nrouter dispatches; app.py the\nFastAPI monolith is retired, not\n\"dispersed into what it imports\"
OTHERAPPS --> TOOLS : same shape for the other\ntwo component monoliths
TOOLS --> ROUTER : the router is the single\ndispatch surface
FCFILES ..> LIB : embedding_client is a duplicate\nof the lib facade (BUG-003)

package "Populations that have reached a settled home" #f5fbfa {
  component "React shell + widgets -> Website/FindCareChat/" as MOVED_SHELL
  component "about-content 'me' ->\nsharedServices/Code/AboutChatHealthy/me" as MOVED_ME
  component "Geo -> sharedServices/Code/Geo/geo_tool.py ONLY.\nFindCare/Geo/ holds no tracked source\n(only __pycache__) — the duplication the\nold diagram warned of is resolved this way." as MOVED_GEO
  component "iPhone / UX walkthrough tests ->\nfeature tests dirs\n(e.g. FindCare/SpecialtyFilter/tests)" as MOVED_UX
  component "Shared/ops (Caddyfile, certs, ops scripts,\ntools) -> only under build staging (/deploy, gitignored)" as MOVED_OPS
}

MOVED_SHELL -[#9ca3af]-> WEBSITE

package "Build tooling — decoupled from the business tree" #f7f7fb {
  component "architecture/DevOpsBuildDeployAndEnvironmentManagement/\nvite.config.ts, hf_helpers.py, _build_chain.py,\n_deploy_chain.py, preflight_undefined_names.py" as BUILDTOOL
  component "build_architecture.json\nFindCareChat.source_root = Website/FindCareChat\ndist = build/react/FindCareChat" as BUILDARCH
}

BUILDTOOL --> BUILDARCH : reads source_root here\ninstead of hardcoding Code/ConversationalUX
BUILDTOOL ..> WEBSITE : resolves the React source\nfrom the declared root

note bottom of GATES
  Gate 1 "the legacy tree is gone": files_still_in_it = 0
  (top-level Code/ genuinely empty and unreferenced),
  BUT it counts the substring "Code/" and so is inflated
  by CURRENT paths — sharedServices/Code (77 in the record),
  pipeline/Code, evaluateCare/Code, FindCare/Code. As written
  it cannot reach green while any component keeps a Code/ dir.
  Gate 2 "declared equals dispatched": CANNOT EVALUATE — the
  record declares 7 tools in PascalCase (ProviderSearch), the
  code declares 19 in snake_case (provider_search), 0 adopt
  the CapabilityContract; there is no join. Gate 3 "a
  declaration states where a tool is served": PASS.
end note

note bottom of APP
  The tree is fully retired only when every route is a
  router-dispatched tool, the three app.py monoliths are gone,
  and nothing authored remains under any component Code/ dir.
  Until then the monoliths are parked, running beside the
  router that already dispatches their successors.
end note

note right of TOOLS
  Facility work still sits under sharedServices/Code
  (FacilitySearch, FacilitySelection), not under FindCare/,
  so a facility route has no FindCare feature directory to
  land in. provider_search_tool.py and provider_detail_tool.py
  likewise live in the router directory today, not in
  FindCare/ProviderList or FindCare/ProviderDetail.
  find_care_facade.py + prompt_system_maker.py have no
  settled feature home; choosing one is an architecture
  decision, not to be guessed here.
end note

@enduml
